{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>חמת</b> — construct state, but what it is bound to is not written, like: ושכורת (and the one to whom it is bound is unspecified)." "And the meaning of חמת — a deadly poison." "And the meaning of אוטם אזנו — it is what is specified afterwards: אשר לא ישמע, ולא לקול חובר חברים."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 58, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:32:08.347478420Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}